    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be cyricsceat.] [Ld] Gif hwa þonne þegna sy þe on his boclande circan hæbbe þe legerstow on sy, gesylle þone þriddan dæl his agenra tepðunga into his circan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If however, there is a thegn who, on the land which he holds by title-deed, has a church to which is attached a graveyard, he shall pay the third part of his own tithes to his church.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hwa þonne ðegna sý, ðe on his bóclande cyrican habbe, þe legerstow on sy, gesylle he þane þriddan dæl his agenre tepðunge into his cyrican.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
